Registration data (expiration dates, registrars, statuses) belongs to the
domain registries. It is read at run time from their public RDAP and whois
services, located through the lists of the IANA; test/fixtures holds a few
answers recorded for the tests (the contact blocks of the .it answer removed).
This community integration is not affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by
any registry, registrar or the IANA.
